### Balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/credits/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Active packages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/credits/packages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create purchase order; price and credits come from the database
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/credits/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}-order

{
  "packageId": "{{packageId}}"
}

### Purchase history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/credits/orders?limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Order detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/credits/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Start mock payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/credits/orders/{{orderId}}/start-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cancel unpaid order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/credits/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Ledger history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/credits/transactions?limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Common error: unknown package
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/credits/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}-bad-package

{
  "packageId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000"
}

